# ------------------------------------------------------ SQ4 PAYMENTS
PY-01|Software|squad:payments|Sprint 0|task|P0|3|Scaffold the billing service with a multi-currency money type|No floats for money. ZAR, KES, NGN and GHS from day one.
PY-02|Software|squad:payments|Sprint 1|story|P0|5|Generate a consolidated invoice across all services|One invoice covering connectivity, colocation and energy lines rather than three separate bills.
PY-03|Software|squad:payments|Sprint 2|story|P0|5|Pay an invoice through a sandbox payment provider|Sandbox only. No real payment rails, no real card data, no PCI scope, ever.
PY-04|Software|squad:payments|Sprint 2|story|P1|5|Wallet balance and top-up flow|Prepaid balance drawn down by usage-based services.
PY-05|Software|squad:payments|Sprint 3|story|P0|5|Handle payment webhooks idempotently|The provider will retry. Replaying the same webhook must never double-credit an account.
PY-06|Software|squad:payments|Sprint 3|story|P2|3|Download a statement as a PDF|Date-ranged, with a per-service breakdown. Use an open-source PDF library.
PY-07|Software|squad:payments|Sprint 4|task|P0|3|Reconcile failed and duplicate payments|A daily job that surfaces mismatches for a human rather than silently correcting them.
PY-08|Software|squad:payments|Sprint 4|bug|P0|2|Rounding error on multi-currency invoice totals|Totals drift by a cent on mixed-currency invoices. Fix it and add property-based tests.
