# -------------------------------------------------- SQ6 AI ASSISTANT
AI-01|Software|squad:ai|Sprint 0|task|P0|3|Scaffold the assistant service and define its tool interface|Define the read-only tools the assistant may call against the other five services.
AI-02|Software|squad:ai|Sprint 1|spike|P0|3|Design retrieval over account, order and invoice data|Timebox two days. Consider an open-source vector store such as pgvector or Qdrant. Output an ADR.
AI-03|Software|squad:ai|Sprint 2|story|P0|8|Answer account questions grounded in the customer's own data|Questions like when my link will be installed, or what my last invoice covered, answered from real records rather than guesses.
AI-04|Software|squad:ai|Sprint 2|story|P0|5|Enforce tenant isolation so no cross-customer data can leak|The assistant must never see or return another organisation's data. Write adversarial tests.
AI-05|Software|squad:ai|Sprint 3|story|P1|5|Escalate to a human support ticket when confidence is low|Better to hand off than to invent an answer. Carry the conversation context into the ticket.
AI-06|Software|squad:ai|Sprint 3|story|P1|3|Show citations linking every answer back to its source record|The customer can click through and verify.
AI-07|Software|squad:ai|Sprint 4|task|P0|3|Build a prompt-injection and jailbreak guardrail test suite|Run it in CI. A regression here is a security incident, not a bug.
AI-08|Software|squad:ai|Sprint 4|task|P2|3|Log and cap assistant usage per customer|Track requests and cost per organisation and stop runaway usage.
# SQ6 AI ASSISTANT — DevOps ownership (same six for every software squad)
AI-D1|Software|squad:ai|Sprint 0|task|P0|3|Containerise the service with a multi-stage build and a non-root user|You build it, you ship it. Small image, no secrets baked in, pinned base image, healthcheck. CL3 reviews it but does not write it for you.
AI-D2|Software|squad:ai|Sprint 1|task|P0|3|Write and own your service's CI pipeline|Call CL3's reusable workflow: lint, unit test, Trivy scan, SBOM, build, sign. Green pipeline is your squad's responsibility, not the platform team's.
